			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150310101,
					"content": "首領阿卡特將「沃陸之邦」的眾人召集到了一起，瓦雷莎簡要地說明了蘑菇的調查進展。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150310102,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿卡特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310103,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托力"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310104,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊安珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310105,
					"content": "我們在調查的時候感覺還好，現在從旁聽者的角度聽了一遍，感覺的確有點荒唐。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310106,
					"content": "這種難以言述的沉默…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150310107,
					"content": "原來如此，果園裡的蘑菇居然有自己的意識，這可是個不得了的發現啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿卡特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310108,
					"content": "#是啊，要是沒有{F#妳}{M#你}們的調查，說不定會醞釀出很可怕的危機。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊安珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310109,
					"content": "#幸虧{F#妳}{M#你}們察覺到了，還收集了這麼多線索！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "豪特利"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310110,
					"content": "太好了，你們沒覺得我講的故事很奇怪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦雷莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310111,
					"content": "哈哈哈，奇怪是奇怪，畢竟和蘑菇說話這種事，我們誰都沒經歷過啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿卡特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310112,
					"content": "但是瓦雷莎妳從來都不是會騙人的孩子，這我們也都知道，再加上綠蘑菇對我們來說本來就是個謎題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿卡特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310113,
					"content": "#現在既然發現了不好的苗頭，我們大家當然都很願意支持{F#妳}{M#你}們的調查！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿卡特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310114,
					"content": "有什麼需要幫忙的，儘管說就好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊安珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310115,
					"content": "你們接受得好快！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310116,
					"content": "太謝謝你們了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150310117,
					"content": "剛剛說，需要用高溫烹飪這種蘑菇對吧？稍等，我現在就去準備。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托力"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310118,
					"content": "來了來了，我直接用鐵盤煎了一下，這個溫度應該夠高！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托力"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310119,
					"content": "哇，果然是很香的味道呢，我的食慾全都回來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310120,
					"content": "那、那我們就不客氣了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦雷莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310121,
					"content": "嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "比夫蘢"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310122,
					"content": "聽到了嗎？是它的聲音！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310123,
					"content": "#哈哈哈哈，看來{F#妳}{M#你}們是摸到了一點竅門，可是這種溫度完全——展現不出絲毫的誠意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "比夫蘢"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310124,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們以為用家常的火，家常的工具，隨便做一做，就能得到「蕈之賢主」的賞識？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "比夫蘢"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310125,
					"content": "人類真是讓我失望，有提示的時候，還能用智慧解決我留下的難題…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "比夫蘢"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310126,
					"content": "結果沒有提示，馬上就原形畢露，採用的辦法真是愚不可及。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "比夫蘢"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310127,
					"content": "再去想想辦法吧，嘻嘻嘻嘻——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "比夫蘢"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310128,
					"content": "怎、怎麼樣，聽到它的聲音了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托力"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310129,
					"content": "可惡，這傢伙果然很討厭！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310130,
					"content": "它說溫度還不夠高，達不到它的要求…太難伺候了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310131,
						150310132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310131,
					"content": "但是要弄清楚它想搞什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150310133,
					"content": "溫度不夠高，那看來得用更厲害的手段才行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿卡特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310134,
					"content": "聽到了嗎，各位，麻煩大家去收集一些高溫的東西，什麼都行！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿卡特"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310135,
					"content": "我去想想辦法！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托力"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310136,
					"content": "交給我吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊安珊"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310137,
					"content": "那我們也去找找？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦雷莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310138,
					"content": "好啊，但這附近我們還不是很熟，你有什麼想法嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310139,
					"content": "嗯…目前還沒有眉目，但我們可以去火山附近看看…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦雷莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310140,
					"content": "火山總是吐各式各樣的東西出來，說不定就會有很好的素材。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦雷莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310141,
					"content": "沒問題，走吧！要是有機會的話，我要把找到的燙燙素材，甩到這個壞蘑菇的臉上！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310132,
					"content": "也只能繼續配合它了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310133
					]
				}
			]
		},
